{'symbol': 'GWW', 'date': '2022-12-15 08:00:00', 'title': 'GRAINGER NAMES NANCY BERARDINELLI-KRANTZ AS CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER', 'text': 'CHICAGO , DEC. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GRAINGER (NYSE: GWW), THE LEADING BROAD LINE DISTRIBUTOR OF MAINTENANCE, REPAIR AND OPERATING (MRO) PRODUCTS SERVING BUSINESSES AND INSTITUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS APPOINTED NANCY L. BERARDINELLI-KRANTZ AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JAN. 30, 2023.'}